      "role": "user",
      "content": "i finally did it. got the promotion, the title, the whole thing. everything i've spent the last ten years working for is finally right in front of me. and i just feel... nothing. like i'm standing at the top of a mountain and it's just gray and empty. there's nothing left to do now.",
