    "summary": "The user expresses profound existential emptiness and exhaustion after achieving long-term professional goals, hinting at the lack of purpose in continuing life. The assistant responds with empathetic, philosophical reframing, suggesting the user shift from \"doing\" to \"being\" and allowing themselves permission to exist without objectives.",
